a lawful god who only bestows lawful artifacts upon characters who
are co-aligned would not stand idly by when non-co-aligned characters
attempt to use lawful artifacts.  the same with other alignments and
artifacts.  if a player desires lawful artifacts, the player should
(seriously) consider changing alignments else face the consequences.
let's assume a neutral character has found a lawful artifact and
attempts to use it.  certainly this action would draw the attention
of the neutral and lawful gods in that game.  what happens next
should probably depend upon the players alignment rating and possibly
other factors ...

